          "source_quote": "λέγω δὲ τά τε χρώματα, ῥάμφη ὄνυχας, βλέμματα, γνώμας, φθέγματα καὶ τὰ λοιπὰ πάντα.",
          "english_quote": "colors, beaks, claws, looks, dispositions, sounds, and everything else.",
          "issue": "The list is covered, but the preceding colon replaces rather than translates the author's explicit first-person clarification, λέγω δὲ. Its explanatory function survives, but the speaker's statement does not.",
          "suggested_revision": "Introduce the list explicitly: “I mean colors, beaks, claws, looks, dispositions, sounds, and everything else.”",
          "severity": "minor"
        }
